{
  "uid": "financial-failures",
  "title": "Financial Core - Failures",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "tags": [
    "financial-core",
    "mvp"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "HTTP 4xx + 5xx since start",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(financial_http_requests_total{service_name=~\"${service:pipe}\",route=~\"${http_route:regex}\",method=~\"${http_method:regex}\",status=~\"${http_status:regex}\",status=~\"4..|5..\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "Servico filtra este painel. Filtros HTTP/Kafka afetam suas respectivas metricas; nivel, texto e Trace ID afetam somente logs."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Worker handler errors since start",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(financial_kafka_messages_total{service_name=~\"${service:pipe}\",topic=~\"${kafka_topic:regex}\",result=~\"${kafka_result:regex}\",result=\"error\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "Servico filtra este painel. Filtros HTTP/Kafka afetam suas respectivas metricas; nivel, texto e Trace ID afetam somente logs."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "HTTP failures by route and status",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route,status) (rate(financial_http_requests_total{service_name=~\"${service:pipe}\",route=~\"${http_route:regex}\",method=~\"${http_method:regex}\",status=~\"${http_status:regex}\",status=~\"4..|5..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} {{status}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "Servico filtra este painel. Filtros HTTP/Kafka afetam suas respectivas metricas; nivel, texto e Trace ID afetam somente logs."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Kafka handler error rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name,topic) (rate(financial_kafka_messages_total{service_name=~\"${service:pipe}\",topic=~\"${kafka_topic:regex}\",result=~\"${kafka_result:regex}\",result=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} {{topic}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "Servico filtra este painel. Filtros HTTP/Kafka afetam suas respectivas metricas; nivel, texto e Trace ID afetam somente logs."
    },
    {
      "title": "Correlated warning/error logs - expand for trace link",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service=~\"${service:pipe}\"} |= ${log_search:doublequote} |= ${trace_id:doublequote} | json | level=~\"${log_level:regex}\" | level=~\"WARN|ERROR\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "id": 5,
      "description": "Servico filtra este painel. Filtros HTTP/Kafka afetam suas respectivas metricas; nivel, texto e Trace ID afetam somente logs."
    },
    {
      "title": "Investigating failures",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Expand a JSON log and click **View trace**. HTTP 400/403 examples represent expected validation/business rejections. Handler error counts do not include broker connectivity or commit failures. No artificial worker failures were injected.\n\n[Back to overview](/d/financial-overview) ? [Explore traces](/explore)\n\nFiltros no topo: servico; HTTP (rota/metodo/status); Kafka (topico/resultado); logs (nivel/texto/Trace ID). **Texto e Trace ID sao buscas literais**. Filtros HTTP nao ocultam logs dos workers; filtros Kafka nao ocultam logs HTTP. Niveis/rotas explicitos podem excluir mensagens antigas sem campos JSON."
      },
      "id": 6,
      "description": "Servico filtra este painel. Filtros HTTP/Kafka afetam suas respectivas metricas; nivel, texto e Trace ID afetam somente logs."
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Investigar logs e traces",
      "url": "/d/financial-investigation",
      "type": "link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "url": "/d/financial-overview",
      "type": "link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Servico",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "API : financial-core.*,Audit : audit.*,Notifications : notification.*",
